# A bare name of another module with no `use` is `unknown-name` (Semantics ch. 6: a name
# is written bare through `use`; Jimmy's ruling QN: a qualified name needs none, so the
# qualified `Words.Name` beside it is fine). Expected text derived by hand. Written by
# Claude on the claude-bugs branch; subject to change.
emit Ui.*
mod Words

@main: @unit
@main:
    Ui.Label($text=$"{Words.Name 2} {Name 3}")
